##
## Project-wide overrides (committed)
##
## .bazelrc imports this file near its end, so settings here layer on top of
## the starter baseline. Per-developer settings belong in user.bazelrc instead.
##

# --- BEGIN user-managed ---
# Project-specific Bazel flags — preserved across re-bootstrap. Typical entries
# point Bazel at a custom certificate store (e.g. behind a TLS-inspecting
# proxy):
#   startup --host_jvm_args=-Djavax.net.ssl.trustStore=/path/to/cacerts
# --- END user-managed ---
